{"_id":"6a2ff4a32204ffbc59e5a55e","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"bIblb5cVNSZLqSuskmKnP","description":"# Pandas\n\nPandas is the primary data manipulation library for Python. It provides two core data structures: Series (one-dimensional) and DataFrame (two-dimensional tabular data). Pandas supports loading data from many formats, cleaning, transforming, grouping, merging, and exporting data, covering the full data preparation workflow.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"10 minutes to pandas","url":"https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/user_guide/10min.html","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb35"},{"type":"article","title":"Pandas Tutorial","url":"https://www.w3schools.com/python/pandas/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb36"},{"type":"video","title":"Learn Pandas in 1 hour! ≡ƒÉ╝","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VXtjG_GzO7Q","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb37"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T12:48:35.657Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/bIblb5cVNSZLqSuskmKnP.md"}